# Public OAuth client identifier for the Web application client in GCP project
# `esc-gmail-client`. Committed on purpose — a web OAuth client ID is public by
# nature (it appears in every token request), matching the precedent set by
# esc-chatmail/Configuration/Debug.xcconfig. Create the client per web/README.md
# and paste its ID here.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=REPLACE_ME.apps.googleusercontent.com
